    { "sender": "demo-lin", "accountName": "林小雨", "timestamp": 1787403000, "type": 0, "content": "谢谢你理解。下周三我应该能早点下班，到时我来约你。", "platformMessageId": "demo-012" },

    { "sender": "demo-lin", "accountName": "林小雨", "timestamp": 1787667300, "type": 0, "content": "这两天我可能回复慢一点，项目临近上线，脑子有点乱。", "platformMessageId": "demo-013" },
    { "sender": "demo-zhou", "accountName": "周予安", "timestamp": 1787667720, "type": 0, "content": "收到。你专心处理，我不连环问进度。", "platformMessageId": "demo-014" },
    { "sender": "demo-zhou", "accountName": "周予安", "timestamp": 1787668500, "type": 0, "content": "等上线以后想吃点好的，告诉我一声。", "platformMessageId": "demo-015" },
