    { "sender": "demo-zhou", "accountName": "周予安", "timestamp": 1788259200, "type": 0, "content": "上线顺利吗？不方便聊工作也没关系，我只是来报个到。", "platformMessageId": "demo-017" },
    { "sender": "demo-lin", "accountName": "林小雨", "timestamp": 1788259500, "type": 0, "content": "今天终于过了第一轮，刚下班。谢谢你没有一直追着问。", "platformMessageId": "demo-018" },
    { "sender": "demo-lin", "accountName": "林小雨", "timestamp": 1788259800, "type": 0, "content": "下周三还算数吗？我想兑现那杯咖啡。", "platformMessageId": "demo-019" },
