    { "sender": "demo-zhou", "accountName": "周予安", "timestamp": 1788872820, "type": 0, "content": "我记得你说想自己先理一理。需要建议时再叫我。", "platformMessageId": "demo-023" },
    { "sender": "demo-lin", "accountName": "林小雨", "timestamp": 1788873180, "type": 0, "content": "嗯，这样刚好。还有一件事：我忙的时候不太看手机，不是故意冷落谁。", "platformMessageId": "demo-024" },

    { "sender": "demo-zhou", "accountName": "周予安", "timestamp": 1789183800, "type": 0, "content": "我明白。以后看到你慢回，我会先按你在忙来理解，不让你额外解释。", "platformMessageId": "demo-025" },
    { "sender": "demo-lin", "accountName": "林小雨", "timestamp": 1789184400, "type": 0, "content": "谢谢。也不用每次都小心翼翼，正常做你自己就好。", "platformMessageId": "demo-026" },
